# Trusted roots for company DSC signatures (founder decision D1, 9 Oct 2026; apps/api/src/documents/signed-pdf.ts).
#
# Put the India Controller of Certifying Authorities (CCA) root certificates here, in PEM, exactly as published by the
# CCA (cca.gov.in, "Root Certificates"). A signer's certificate must chain to one of them through a licensed CA.
# This file is data, not code: YukthiX support updates it when the CCA issues or retires a root; set DSC_TRUSTED_ROOTS
# to use another path. While it holds no certificate, every signed upload is refused with a plain reason.
